# scenarios.jsonl itself is the canonical source of truth, so it's not
# regenerable the way the views above are -- but a single 78MB+ file is the
# same problem in a different shape. It's shipped chunked instead: see
# data/scenarios/chunks/ and `scripts/chunk_scenarios.py`. Reassemble locally
# with: cat data/scenarios/chunks/*.jsonl > data/scenarios/scenarios.jsonl
data/scenarios/scenarios.jsonl
